My name is Robert Samuel White. We have never corresponded. On September 3,=
 2026, your Department produced its file on me under public records request=
 PR27478, the threat-assessment case your order created. The production is =
published in full at oprdvolunteerabuse.org.
 This letter concerns that order.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
