The email that reached you on March 3, 2026 described a citizen publishing =
a documented record and writing to his Governor. It alleged no crime and qu=
oted no threat. By morning you had ordered a threat assessment &quot;asap.&=
quot;</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
