Everything in your Department's file descends from that order. The federal =
task force distribution. The fusion center documentation. The driver's reco=
rd. The instruction to my supervisor to conceal the inquiry from me. The sa=
tellite photographs of the place
 where I sleep. The armed visit, through a locked federal gate, on the anni=
versary of the dismissal I had documented. Your own detective reviewed my a=
rchive before anyone drove and recorded that there was nothing. It ran anyw=
ay --- because the concern was never
 safety. It was who was reading my letters.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
