ass=3D"elementToProof">
<b>You command Government and Media Relations. Threat assessment exists for=
 danger to human beings, and you aimed it at a publisher, from the press of=
fice, against a man whose entire conduct was documentation</b>. There is a =
name for a state that does this
 to its critics, and there is no version of your oath that covers it.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
