Your Department has now produced the file. In it, your order stands as the =
first act of state power against me, and every act that followed cites to i=
t. That is what the permanent record holds against your name. It is the sub=
ject of a tort claim served on the
 State of Oregon, in which you are named in your individual capacity.</div>
